A ### MC is quite useful.  You could find or wish for a cloak of magic
resistance and a silver dragon hide/mail, which means you'd have both
MR and reflection without a shield.  Or, the oilskin cloak works well
too, to prevent drowning incidents.
 
Your max HP isn't too bad, considering the Valk's quest artifact
halves most of your damage, but you could raise it a bit through
alchemy. (mixing potions to get extra healing/full healing)
 
